<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BOARD XI 8-0 V ZIMBABWE (307-7 DEC) - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BOARD XI 8-0 V ZIMBABWE (307-7 DEC) - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>SAHIWAL, Pakistan. 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Pakistan Board XI were eight without loss in reply to Zimbabwe's first innings total of 307 for seven declared on the opening day of a three-day match on Saturday.</p>
</text>
